(text "Hirose FH12-22S-0.5SH: official CM4 IO DISP1 pinout. Use the supplied 22-to-15 DISPLAY cable.\nCM4 requires dtoverlay=vc4-kms-dsi-ili9881-5inch. I2C SCL0/SDA0 are display control only.\nDSI pairs stay tightly coupled over a continuous ground plane; no ground-plane splits beneath pairs." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 029c96fc-e9eb-4d16-921f-2ccc7010f746))
